<title>USA: Intimate Brands Inc Q3 Nov 2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Intimate Brands Inc Q3 Nov 2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.11		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			  27,200			N/A</p>
<p> Revs			597,000			N/A</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 shr is pro forma and reflects IPO.</p>
